WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.935
Welcome to Module 13 Introduction to Spark SQL In
earlier

00:00:05.962 --> 00:00:11.741
modules we used PostgreSQL to learn relational
thinking In this module we

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:18.052
keep that same thinking but we move the execution
environment to Spark Spark

00:00:18.078 --> 00:00:23.223
SQL lets us write familiar SQL while Spark plans and
executes the work across distributed

00:00:23.249 --> 00:00:29.724
data The key question is not only whether the query
is correct We

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.842
also ask what data is scanned what has to move
across workers and what one

00:00:33.869 --> 00:00:35.237
output row represents
